</script></span> </div>
                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">时维仲夏，嘉宾盈门；隽秀归来，赤子情深。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>6</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>22</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">日下午，绍兴一中“英贤计划”项目签约仪式在我校养新书藏（图书馆）报告厅隆重举行。浙江省爱乡楷模、维也纳金十字勋章获得者、我校</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1956</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">届校友、“英贤计划”项目发起人鲁家贤先生，中静实业（集团）有限公司董事长、鲁家贤先生之子高央先生，绍兴市委书记马卫光，市委常委、秘书长陆维，副市长顾涛，市政府副秘书长周宝林，市教育局党委书记、局长姚国海，青田县委常委、宣传部长吴飞飞，青田县教育局党委书记、局长陈正彬，青田中学党委书记、校长邓加富，绍兴一中校长朱雯以及我校教育基金会相关负责人等领导嘉宾出席，全体教职员工和学生代表一起见证这一重大时刻。仪式由校党委书记陈银伟主持。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast"></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019062410513741.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019062410520194.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></P></o:p></SPAN></FONT>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">朱雯在致辞时首先对各位领导、嘉宾的到来表示热烈的欢迎，对鲁家贤先生和其子高央先生的助学义举表示崇高的敬意和谢意。朱雯表示，从</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1987</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">年鲁先生捐赠近四万元人民币，设立了一中历史上第一个奖学金——“鲁家贤奖学金”，到</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2017</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">年在一中乔迁与一百二十年校庆双喜来临之际，鲁先生与其子高央先生承诺出资</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">万元人民币实施“英贤计划”项目，奖教奖学，助力一中高位发展，再到今天，这个项目终于正式签约，父子俩人情系故里，在离开一中一个甲子的时间里，始终用实际行动关心关注着一中的教育发展。朱雯代表学校，代表绍兴一中的全体师生向鲁先生和高先生致以最诚挚的感谢。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast"></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019062410523105.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">鲁家贤先生在讲话中谈及母校近年来的发展和成绩，言语中难掩激动和自豪，他说，母校有名，学子有光。学子出力，反哺母校。“英贤计划”项目主要是奖励取得突出教学业绩和为学校作出贡献的老师们，以及品学兼优的学生，希望这个项目能为辛勤耕耘的师生带来一点实实在在的福利。鲁老先生朴实的话语中透露出对母校和深情厚谊，令人动容。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast"></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=宋体><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019062410525724.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">在现场领导、嘉宾和师生的共同见证下，高央、朱雯和卢燎亚分别代表上海高央家人资产经营管理有限公司、绍兴市第一中学和绍兴市第一中学教育基金会郑重签订“英贤计划”项目协议书，标志着这个为期五年的“英贤计划”项目正式启动实施。朱雯代表学校郑重承诺：绍兴一中一定会以对历史负责的态度执行好项目方案，用好每个项目的每一分钱，最大限度发挥“英贤计划”项目奖教奖学的激励功能，使绍兴一中得到更优质更全面的发展，不负先生期望，不负社会所托。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast"></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019062410533986.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">随后，谢澹老师作为教师代表致答谢词。她代表所有一中人再次向鲁家贤先生和高央先生表达了由衷的感谢。她说，美事得成，这当中有三种力量的倾注：支持的力量、帮扶的力量和情怀的力量。作为一中人，我们有责任也有能力让三种力量形成一股合力，落到实处，化为成果，使自己在专业成长上更上层楼，在学生培养上用心用情，让一中在我们这一代人身上更好地延续她的荣光！</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast"></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019062410540933.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">副市长顾涛在最后作了重要讲话。她表示，此次签约仪式是绍兴一中发展历程中的一大盛事，也是我市教育事业发展中的一件喜事，感谢鲁家贤先生和高央先生为绍兴教育贡献了如此厚重的一份心力。顾涛要求学校认真履行协议规定，将“英贤计划”发挥出最大效应；希望老师们坚守“立德树人”的初心，不断提升学校教育教学水平；希望学生在“英贤计划”的激励下，胸怀理想，脚踏实地，做一个德才兼备的人。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast"></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019062410543387.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019062410545979.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></P></o:p></SPAN></FONT>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">签约仪式上还进行了隆重的授奖仪式，市委书记马卫光为鲁家贤先生颁发“绍兴一中特殊贡献奖”，朱雯为高央先生颁发“绍兴一中荣誉校友”证书。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast"></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019062410553148.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019062410560581.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019062410560573.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></P></o:p></SPAN></FONT>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">据悉，绍兴一中“英贤计划”项目共设三个主要项目，一是“杏坛英贤计划”项目，分“英贤教师岗位津贴”和“英贤质量奖”，前者用于特级、正高等人才的引进与补贴，后者用于奖励高考、竞赛取得突出成绩的团队。二是“未来英贤计划”项目，分“英贤访学奖”和“英贤学生奖”，前者每年资助品学兼优但家庭经济相对困难的学生（限额</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>30</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">人）赴海外访学；后者奖励每年在高考与竞赛中成绩优异的学生；三是“绍青英贤计划”项目，开展绍兴一中与青田中学结对帮扶行动，借助绍兴一中的优质教育资源，在教师与学生两个层面对青田中学进行结对帮扶。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">整个“英贤计划”项目从</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">年开始实施，第一期到</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2023</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">年结束，五年共计</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">万。这是绍兴一中创办以来，收到的最大一笔捐赠，必将对绍兴一中的高位发展产生巨大的促进作用。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">大爱济世，大行广德。每一位关心并支持一中发展的爱心人士、每一个五湖四海的一中学子，都是学校最为宝贵的财富，也是学校砥砺前行的力量之源。学校再次感谢鲁家贤先生和高央先生，向他们表示崇高的敬意！自学校</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>120</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast">周年校庆以来，我们感受到了每个一中人对学校的挚爱情怀和责任担当！相信在这种爱的精神感召下，百年一中一定能存古开新，砥砺前行，为绍兴教育事业的创新发展做出自己应有的贡献！</SPAN></FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201906/2019062410582124.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: right; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; WIDOWS: 1; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT: 14px/2em -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); CLEAR: both; WORD-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">供稿：党政办</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: right; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; WIDOWS: 1; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT: 14px/2em -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); CLEAR: both; WORD-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">撰稿：<SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: right; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 32px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">陈忆宁</SPAN></SPAN></P>
    
